The `vox` package is derived from third-party MIT-licensed source.
The original copyright notice and permission text are preserved in LICENSE,
as that license requires.

Local modifications: the package was renamed, the provider registries in
providers.py / transcriber / synthesizer / llms / input_handlers /
output_handlers were converted to lazy imports so unused vendor SDKs are
never imported, and unused upstream scaffolding (examples, CI config, docs)
was removed.
